<!-- @after 12. Further Reading :: recap -->
### Say these in the interview

- Separate the map renderer, location source and routing engine; offline tiles do not imply offline directions.
- Use licensed map data and a bounded region store; this design chooses MapLibre and downloaded PMTiles.
- Save route and step progress before relying on restart recovery. A redelivered intent restores that saved session.
- Serialize navigation replacements through one controller: cancel and finish the previous session before the next collector starts.
- Treat poor accuracy, routing failures and missing service restarts as normal failure paths, with a user-visible recovery action.
